{"id":"en_possession-is-not-love","title":"Possession Is Not Love","titleEn":"Possession Is Not Love","description":"Claire Shaw and Adrian Stone entered a marriage of convenience, keeping their union hidden for four years. Everything shifts when Adrian's first love reappears, prompting Claire to seek a divorce—only to learn she is expecting a child. As jealousy and miscommunication mount between them, Adrian comes to understand that what he felt was not obsession but genuine love. The question remains whether he can reach Claire before he loses her for good.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/possession-is-not-love/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/possession-is-not-love/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Contract Lovers","Slow-Burn Romance","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsh22/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_possession-is-not-love_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsh22/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_possession-is-not-love_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsh22/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_possession-is-not-love_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsh22/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_possession-is-not-love_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsh22/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_possession-is-not-love_5","tit